meta {
  name: Factor Exposures
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/portfolio/factors
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Fundamental exposures (market beta, size, volatility, momentum, sector dummies) alongside a
  PCA of the correlation matrix. `notes` flags when the factor set saturates the universe —
  with six factors over six assets everything classifies as systematic by construction, which is
  an artefact of the setup rather than a finding.
}
